| `semantics/builtins.k:35:12` | `rule` / `ordinary-semantic-rule` | — | `ACCEPTED_SELECTED_SEMANTICS` | `rule <k> #applyK(toCall(builtinV("list")), (str(CS:IntSeq), .Vals))   => #alloc(list(charsOf(CS))) ... </k>` |
